/span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Herod.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.90</span> </span> (dub.); <span class=\"gk\">πάνυ π. γενέσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3.16</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ σκέλη κινεῖν ταχὺ καὶ π.</span>, of a runner, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1361b24</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ πόρρω βάρβαροι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1149a11</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">too far</b>, <span class=\"gk\">καὶ νῦν ἴσως πόρρω ἀποτενοῦμεν [τὸν λόγον</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">458b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ πόρρω ἐθελήσαιμ' ἂν πιεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">176d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in front</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τὰ π. μέρη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.680</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.141</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18(2).265</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> of Time, <b class=\"lex-tr\">forward</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πρόσσω καὶ ὀπίσσω</span>, v. ὀπίσω <span clas